1
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:06,000
Demi Lovato: Simply Complicated is a music,
documentary film directed by Hannah Lux Davis.

2
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:06,000
A personal and intimate look into Demi Lovato's life as not only a regular 25
year old, but also one of the biggest pop stars in the world.

3
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:06,000
Self, played by Demi Lovato.

4
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:06,000
Self, played by Dallas Lovato.

5
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:06,000
Self, played by Madison De La Garza.

6
